OL,3,GNEWSACity-wide balaclava ban being
OL,4,Aconsidered by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council has said it is
OL,7,Flooking closely at launching a
OL,8,Fcity-wide balaclava ban.
OL,10,FIt comes after Nottingham became one of
OL,11,Fthe first cities in the UK to introduce
OL,12,Fa ban on balaclavas last month, giving
OL,13,Fauthorities powers to demand face
OL,14,Fcoverings are removed and issue fines
OL,15,Fif they "reasonably believe" they are
OL,16,Fbeing used to commit crime or
OL,17,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
