OL,3,GNEWSACity-wide balaclava ban being
OL,4,Aconsidered by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-run authority said it was
OL,7,Fclosely monitoring Nottingham's new
OL,8,Fpolicy but no decision had been made
OL,9,Fover whether to enforce such a ban in
OL,10,FDerby.
OL,12,FAccording to a city council survey
OL,13,Fcarried out last year, almost 69% of
OL,14,Ffemales and 68% male participants said
OL,15,Fthey felt "unsafe" walking alone in the
OL,16,Fcity centre at night.
